Honest Pride grant rules belong in `Terms.tsx` §7.7, not on the face. Include: new invites 21 to 31 August 2026 only; printed PRIDE 3MONTH FREE by 5 September 2026; personal earlier-email codes by 31 October 2026; 3 months Premium from launch; one grant; no stacking; replaces 7.2 waitlist gift; 18+; UK-first; not billed; not a sponsor of Southampton Pride or Manchester Village Pride; duration from launch (on-time 1 Oct 2026 → 1 Jan 2027; slip = 3 months from actual open).

